        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Predelta National Park, Entre Ríos, Diamante, Argentine Mesopotamia, Paraná River Delta, Mesopotamia, Argentina, Misiones, Corrientes\n- Organizations: National parks of Argentina\n- Concepts: Geographic regions\n\nFacts:\n- Predelta National Park is a national park of Argentina.\n- Predelta National Park is located in the southwest of Entre Ríos Province, 6 km south of Diamante.\n- Predelta National Park is in the Argentine Mesopotamia at the beginning of the Paraná River Delta.\n- Mesopotamia, Argentina, also called La Mesopotamia or Región Mesopotámica, is a humid and verdant region in northeastern Argentina.\n- Mesopotamia, Argentina, comprises the provinces of Misiones, Entre Ríos, and Corrientes.",
